      "- Risk Assessment Frameworks: Developing risk assessment frameworks for AI applications is a regulatory issue that helps manage potential dangers.\n",
      "- Cybersecurity Regulations: Cybersecurity regulations for AI systems are essential to safeguard against vulnerabilities, making it a significant regulatory issue.\n",
      "\n",
      "=== Data Privacy ===\n",
      "- GDPR Compliance: GDPR compliance is a key regulatory issue that organizations must address to protect personal data in the EU.\n",
      "- CCPA Regulations: CCPA regulations represent significant regulatory issues for businesses operating in California regarding consumer privacy rights.\n",
      "- Notification Timelines: Notification timelines are critical regulatory issues that dictate how quickly organizations must inform affected parties of data breaches.\n",
      "- Regulatory Penalties: Regulatory penalties for failing to notify individuals about data breaches highlight the importance of compliance in data privacy.\n",
      "- Privacy Shield Framework: The Privacy Shield Framework is a significant regulatory issue for companies transferring data between the EU and the US.\n",
      "- Standard Contractual Clauses: Standard contractual clauses are a regulatory mechanism used to ensure compliance when transferring data internationally.\n"
     ]
    }
